Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:12.64,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,相信籠中安全
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:14.40,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,深信此為絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:16.74,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至忘卻創作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:19.53,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,那位置配不上光明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:22.00,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,說出希望 拋下不滿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.89,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,拉起革命的旗幟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:28.43,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,去任何人無法趕上的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:34.44,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,終有一天 超越修羅之外
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:37.05,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,即使現在被壓制
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:39.92,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,使我的臥薪嘗膽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:44.52,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,也不會被奪走夢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:47.37,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,燃燒吧全身神經
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:52.11,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道向誰傳達的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:57.29,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有寄託意義
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:02:02.81,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,向著更光明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:06.85,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,到達頂點為止
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.41,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,have an obsession for victory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:12.03,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm proud of myself and you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:14.91,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,we must be the change we wish to see
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:21.49,shokugeki_text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(300,250)\fs52.5\fn方正大黑_GBK\b0}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作 僅供日語交流之用 請勿轉載
