Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:32.02,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}守りべき正義をすり減らして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.14,0:22:35.38,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}勝ち取るものなどない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:39.05,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}籠の中から見上げた空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.21,0:22:42.62,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}雨上がりの青の眩しさに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:46.05,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}囚われたままじゃ居られない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.05,0:22:49.54,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}昔話なら捨てて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.54,0:22:53.10,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}明日が言うべきは他でもない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:56.77,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}突き動かすほどの本能だ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.93,0:23:00.17,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}ぼくはぼくじゃなきゃ居られない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:03.39,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}変われるほど器用じゃないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:10.41,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}響徹雲霄的霹靂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.67,0:22:13.77,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}被閃光暈眩之時
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:17.42,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}絕對不要發出聲響
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:20.95,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}一動不動地忍受悄然靠近的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.12,0:22:24.54,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}爾虞我詐 難免失去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:27.99,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}爭吵不斷 相互奪取
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:32.02,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}本應守護的正義慢慢衰退
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.14,0:22:35.38,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}便無法贏取任何東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:39.05,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}從籠中向上仰視的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.21,0:22:42.62,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}被雨後的藍色所閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:46.05,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}不會就此甘願被囚禁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.05,0:22:49.54,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}舊事都一併丟棄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.54,0:22:53.10,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}明天要暢談的東西沒有別的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:56.77,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}是幾乎拉扯我前進的本能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.93,0:23:00.17,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}我不管什麼時候都必須是我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:03.39,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}因為我並不擅於改變
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:06.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,集合50人的軍隊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:08.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,從現在算起用不了一個小時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.37,0:00:11.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,搬離完成的報告就會發給我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.15,0:00:13.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:15.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友們正在面臨巨大的危機
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:17.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不甘心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:19.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你重視的宿舍要被摧毀了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:21.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒用了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:24.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這場食戟的勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:27.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,即使這樣 還是要比嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:33.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,上啊 強制搬離
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:41.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:45.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣失去我們的宿舍什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:47.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:24.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\p1\fad(450,0)\bord0\c&H000000&\blur22.5\pos(314.571,417)\fscx472\fscy373}m 0 0 b 0 -6 76.5 -6 76.5 0 b 76.5 7.5 0 6 0 0
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:24.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs97.5\fad(450,0)\bord1.2\pos(315.429,402.714)}鍊金術師
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:26.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山枝津也 到底有多卑鄙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:27.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.78,0:02:30.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:33.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果我贏了這場食戟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:37.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,極星寮的強制搬離就會被取消對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:38.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:40.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣說也沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那就無所謂了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:44.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好好做料理就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:49.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 你想做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:51.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,做餃子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:52.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,餃子？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:54.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 居然是餃子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:58.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要把高級食材做出庶民的味道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:00.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,的確有新意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,有新意呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:02.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣處理不好的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:05.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,走地雞的上等回味就會消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:08.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 請看著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:10.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不要礙事 龍膽…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:11.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:12.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:17.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,預先處理好的走地雞肉 不與空氣接觸放置一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:18.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在這期間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:20.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,將韭菜 捲心菜 冬菇切末備用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:22.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,生薑和蒜也同樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.55,0:03:27.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,調味料用醬油 黑胡椒 蚝油這些來調製
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.57,0:03:30.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 請看著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:35.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平 就別再逞強了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:37.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,勝負顯而易見
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可以回去的地方也要沒有了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:43.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,逞英雄以食戟挑戰的下場就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.59,0:03:48.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,承認吧 你已經連做料理的力氣都沒了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到了嗎 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:54.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,強制搬離結束了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:57.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…其實…這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:03:58.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,放水
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,遭到了頑強的防禦抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:08.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣失去極星寮什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:10.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:13.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道你們會這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:14.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,文緒阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:19.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,宿舍阿姨 這個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:22.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,極星寮黃金時代的遺產
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:25.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候快速發展的同時
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.69,0:04:28.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,遭人嫉恨是常有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:31.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,被其他同學襲擊也時有發生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:33.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:36.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是就算再抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:38.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,結果也不會改變
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:43.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是創真君現在正在一個人戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:44.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,所以至少
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,撐到幸平的食戟結束就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:50.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前一定要保護好這個宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:54.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓幸平孤軍奮戰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:58.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,極星！fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:10.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一個兩個的 為什麼都不屈服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:11.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:17.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,前輩好像很~喜歡一直置身事外地旁敲側擊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:20.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有什麼想對我說的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:22.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,能好好地用料理說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:26.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.67,0:05:30.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,歸根結底能讓你屈服的只有料理是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:34.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,能品嚐到叡山閣下認真製作的料理嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:37.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有白白過來看鬧劇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 菜單確定了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.35,0:05:43.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,激活蕯摩走地雞全部的美味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:46.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,端出一道精緻佳肴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:49.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你也嚐嚐 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:53.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可以理解一下你和我的格局的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:56.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山選的食材和調味料
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.42,0:05:59.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要做的大概就是那個了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:04.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一整隻雞放進鍋裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,多麼豪爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.25,0:06:10.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣放置大約30分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:14.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,利用餘熱漸漸加熱雞的內部
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:16.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,通過這個過程
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:20.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不會破壞蕯摩走地雞本來的柔軟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:23.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,產生厚實溫和的特等口感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,對火候的掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:29.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是對全雞處理的技術的關鍵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:33.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,加熱的同時炒製雞皮將油脂慢慢炒出來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:37.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,再用那個清爽細膩的油
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:40.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,炒製大蒜 生薑 生米
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你在看什麼 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛 怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:51.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想 叡山前輩原來會做菜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,果然 幸平你太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:57.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 你的心情我理解
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:00.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山看起來就是一個有文化的痞子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:04.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 這傢伙意外的有實力哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:07.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,如果沒有陷入諮詢業的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:12.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,現十傑成員裡多少會有幾個人要被他踩在腳底
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:19.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼首先陳述一下來本校入學考試的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:20.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正楷体_GBK\bord0\c&H4B4B4C&\frz268.8\b1\move(1638,555,1488,555)}遠月學園中學部 入學考試 面試會場
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:20.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山枝津也君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:22.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,為了賺錢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:25.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山從入學以來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,從諮詢業賺的總額
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:31.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,超過了那個學年全部學生的學費
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:35.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,充分利用遠月擁有的人脈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:37.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,經手的案件超過500件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:38.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不同的領域
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:39.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不同的條件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:42.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都超越完美地完成工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:43.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:47.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,若沒有對無數的料理種類和味覺世界精通的才華
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:49.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不可能辦到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:52.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,結果全場一致通過入選十傑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:55.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,他為學園帶來巨大利益
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:08:01.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\p1\fad(250,0)\bord0\c&H000000&\blur22.5\fscx472\fscy373\pos(1607.571,969)}m 0 0 b 0 -6 76.5 -6 76.5 0 b 76.5 7.5 0 6 0 0
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:08:01.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs97.5\fad(250,0)\bord0\shad0.75\pos(1608.429,954.714)}鍊金術師
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:58.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,無疑就是鍊金術師
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:01.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,最適合這個稱號的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:09.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把煲湯時炒製的生米
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:14.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用飽含走地雞特有的清澈鮮味的高湯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:16.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,煲泰國香米嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:18.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說作為經營者不合格
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:21.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我就先把收支置之度外
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:23.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,戰略是料理的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:27.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有勝算沒有計劃就來食戟挑戰我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:30.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,後悔著從遠月消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:33.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然戰略這種東西的確沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:37.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這並不是什麼勝算都沒有的挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:42.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,有想要通過這場食戟讓前輩看到的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:46.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,審查員的各位請也抱著這種心情拭目以待
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:48.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:50.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,餃子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:52.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不是普通的餃子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:54.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不是用小麥粉做的皮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用雞翅尖代替面皮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:08:59.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:02.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,取出大小兩根骨頭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.94,0:09:04.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在那裡面填滿餡料
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:07.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,蕯摩走地雞的雞翅餃子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:08.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:12.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好香的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:15.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,豬肉和韭菜 捲心菜 冬菇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:17.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還加上大塊的豬頸肉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.09,0:09:20.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點 快一點 快點煎好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:22.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,龍膽前輩也要吃麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:25.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,無所謂 反正我多準備了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:26.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:30.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你 不用做我們的份也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:33.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這種B級美食家做出來的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:34.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:36.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,吃的必要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:38.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那幾個審查員是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:41.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,三個都是叡山的共同經營者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:43.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,全部是料理界裡的熟面孔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:45.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,與中樞也關係緊密
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:48.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,對料理的鑑賞能力 還算正確
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:54.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這道菜 我店裡的客人評價很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:58.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小林龍膽 你也是中樞的成員
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.27,0:10:01.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,為這種程度的菜品浪費時間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:03.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你不覺得不妥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:08.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一定要吃過了再做判斷主義的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:11.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,餡料用豬頸肉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:15.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,蕯摩走地雞的上等細膩的味道都破壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:19.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不用嘗都知道 完全是在浪費食材
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:21.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,懂了嗎幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:24.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你的料理就是這種水準
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:25.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:28.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,陪我看這場鬧劇的謝禮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.41,0:10:30.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,嚐嚐看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:32.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,海南雞飯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:33.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\c&H000000&\blur22.5\fscx0\t(0,1400,\fscx458)\fscy343\pos(781.001,681)}m 39 0 b 39 -6 115.5 -6 115.5 0 b 115.5 7.5 39 6 39 0
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:33.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs90\clip(810,585,810,666)\t(0,1400,\clip(810,585,1118,666))\bord0\pos(961.999,672)}海南雞飯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:37.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,有「khao man kai」 新加坡雞飯各種各樣的叫法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:37.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}「khao man kai」:泰語 雞肉飯的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:41.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在東南亞廣為流傳的傳統菜譜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:43.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你的份
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.47,0:10:46.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:53.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,纖細並且澎湃的美味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:56.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,被完美煮過的柔軟肉質
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:59.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,回味無窮這種風味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:04.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這次準備了三種醬汁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:07.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,辣椒和雞湯的智利辣醬油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:07.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,450)}{\p1\bord0\c&H000000&\blur19.5\fscx441\fscy227\pos(186,816)}m 39 0 b 39 -6 115.5 -6 115.5 0 b 115.5 7.5 39 6 39 0
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:07.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,450)}{\bord0\an7\pos(208,748)}智利辣醬油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:10.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,生薑和雞油做的生薑醬汁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.39,0:11:11.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,450)\pos(829.2,981.6)}{\p1\bord0\c&H000000&\blur19.5\fscx441\fscy227}m 39 0 b 39 -6 115.5 -6 115.5 0 b 115.5 7.5 39 6 39 0
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.39,0:11:11.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,450)\pos(880.001,916.001)}{\bord0\an7\pos(208,748)}生薑醬汁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:14.65,shokugeki_text,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fad(400,400)\bord0\c&H000000&\blur19.5\fscx441\fscy227\pos(1329,501)}m 39 0 b 39 -6 115.5 -6 115.5 0 b 115.5 7.5 39 6 39 0
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:14.65,shokugeki_text,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\fad(400,400)\pos(1348.001,436)}泰國黑醬油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:15.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還有泰國料理不可或缺的醬油的一種「泰國黑醬油」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:15.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1413,996)}shiyudamu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:18.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和肉的搭配毋庸置疑是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:22.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,發揮走地雞優點的想法及調味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山枝津也這個傢伙的料理品味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:27.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,發揮地至細至微
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,極品的走地雞的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:31.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,通過調味更上一層樓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:33.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,名副其實
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:34.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,美味鍊金術
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:35.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我來嚐嚐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:41.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:44.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是鍊金術師做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 幸平創真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:50.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你的料理與中樞相差十萬八千里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:51.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,理解了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:56.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我的料理還完全沒有完成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:12:01.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,最後的一道工序我的餃子就終於完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.57,0:12:04.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你小伎倆 也就那點水平
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:06.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,水平的差距是一目了然的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:09.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山閣下 這是浪費時間的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,已經可以判定了麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:13.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係 判吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:16.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來食戟就結束了 結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:18.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,先別這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:23.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,只有叡山前輩來嘗一嘗也沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:25.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？還是說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.93,0:12:30.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,前輩在害怕 我做出來的料理嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.24,0:12:38.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不怕的話嚐一下也無所謂的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:41.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,被我說到這個份上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,嘗都不嘗就回去不是顯得很狼狽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.19,0:12:46.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你 你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在好像想吃了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:51.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:55.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 走過路過不要錯過
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.18,0:12:58.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我的餃子的真正的姿態
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:12:59.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要現身了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎麼做啊 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:05.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就算讓他們審查
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:08.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,他們可是都被叡山收買了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:10.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,給我看看吧 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.49,0:13:13.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是那樣也就結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:16.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好好享受在學園裡面的最後一次料理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:22.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,比賽之前就開始準備的薩摩走地雞骨湯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.01,0:13:24.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那兩個容器是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:26.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,已經足夠熱了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:28.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雞翅膀的皮看起來也很不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.91,0:13:30.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就在這個時候加入水分
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:37.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,芝士？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:39.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,帕瑪森芝士
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:40.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:43.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平的餃子是翅膀煎餃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:48.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,翅膀煎餃本來是用溶有小麥粉的水製作的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:51.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平想到用帕瑪森芝士也能做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:57.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,都看到了麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:14:02.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,終於變成真正不像話的B級料理了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:06.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,本來餡料用豬頸肉的時候就已經浪費掉雞的風味了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:08.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之上居然還用上了芝士
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:10.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,相當於把走地雞那上等的風味
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.09,0:14:13.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用多餘的東西亂七八糟地抹掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:18.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和極其精練的叡山殿下的菜品相比是完全相反的極端
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:21.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是浪費時間
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:23.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那鍋雞骨湯是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 讓我們進行判定然後結束掉這場食戟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:36.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來了 雞翅的水分飛濺的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:37.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就是現在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:44.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把雞骨湯…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:46.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是最後的工序
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:52.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把加有澱粉的雞骨湯芡汁澆上去就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:54.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請慢用 叡山前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:00.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,無聊透頂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你想說這些芡汁有什麼大作用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:05.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不過是把這一道處理的工序加了進來而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:06.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我確信了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:10.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然是遠月中不需要的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.41,0:15:24.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了睿山前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:28.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,難道說你覺得我的餃子很美味？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:29.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:31.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那種B級菜品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:32.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:34.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們說到那種份上的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:36.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,嚐嚐看不是更容易理解嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:38.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來 請用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:42.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 叡山前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:46.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,前輩也覺得我的料理很美味對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:50.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,誰的菜品更美味 不想分個清楚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:52.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,荒謬至極
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:53.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:55.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有品嘗的必要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.99,0:15:57.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我要開始判定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:03.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,嚐過一口之後再判定也沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:07.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,勝負都已經是板上釘釘的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:10.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:12.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:15.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 很抱歉 我就來吃一口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:17.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 我也來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來了 讓您久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:30.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來了來了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:32.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我也趁熱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:33.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小林龍膽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:37.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,叡山都吃得那麼香了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:39.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那還怎麼能讓我忍住不吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個很好吃啊 幸平創真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:51.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用那麼亂七八糟的處理手段
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:56.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,能把走地雞的風味突顯成這種地步
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:58.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個答案就是芡汁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:00.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在走地雞的湯汁中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.22,0:17:03.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,加入醬油 酒 醋 砂糖 芝麻油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:06.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,然後還有一樣秘料
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有秘料
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:11.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是番茄醬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:16.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把番茄醬作為秘料特製的甜醋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:17.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,番茄醬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:20.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在糖醋裡脊和天津飯中使用到的甜醋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:25.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這在用油較多的中華料理中添加清爽的口感再合適不過了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.99,0:17:28.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,通過加入番茄醬的酸味
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:32.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,僅僅留住豬頸肉和帕瑪森芝士的醇厚和多汁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:36.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,突出走地雞本身那上等的餘味了麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:40.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,番茄中含有谷胺酸這種美味成分的集合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和帕瑪森芝士也很搭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.69,0:17:47.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,走地雞和香菇的美味成分相結合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:49.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,發揮了相乘的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:53.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,乍一看 不過是把各種點子亂加進去的B級料理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:54.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和精煉二字背道相馳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:55.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.08,0:18:00.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,嚐過之後 再也想不出其他更棒的組合了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.59,0:18:02.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎麼樣想出這個點子的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這並不是我一個人想出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:09.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這種情況下加入番茄的這個想法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:13.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是和極星寮那幫傢伙一起想出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請安心 繪里奈大人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:21.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不會讓他們做出無禮的事情的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:23.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,緋沙子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:23.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.78,0:18:28.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,總感覺這個宿舍的人有點不可思議
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.51,0:18:30.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不可思議麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:34.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小繪里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:35.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來復仇了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:39.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都這樣還真是不厭煩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:41.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為昨天你也說了很多次不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:43.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就要讓你說出好吃二字
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:48.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說你按照我說的 把菜譜改變了麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:54.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 既然作為食客 今天也來試吃你的料理…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:58.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這和我說的完全不同啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:18:59.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:03.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我說過了吧 肉凍是低溫狀態提供的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:06.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為現在還熱著就端出來 肉質就不緊實了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:08.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而且在最好讓牛肝菌醬作為主角的情況下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:12.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,偏偏還要把味道突出的戈貢佐拉奶酪的醬汁加進去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:15.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來肯定比昨天的還要難吃…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.55,0:19:18.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:20.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然這道菜未經過精雕細琢還是很粗糙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:23.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是敢於把味道強烈的食材碰撞在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:25.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,從而增加了雙方的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.79,0:19:27.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:31.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來 豬肉油脂的感覺就太過強烈了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.06,0:19:33.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,風味就混亂了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:36.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是想保留味道的醇厚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:38.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小繪里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 這種組合不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:42.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雞肉和豬肉同時這樣處理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:44.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說什麼都加進來就會變好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:47.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不去做點減法的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:49.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}等等 再把酸味加進去如何
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:51.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說話呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:52.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:54.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不僅可以保留雞的美味和豬肉的醇厚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:57.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還能消除油膩感那樣的酸味
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:19:59.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,酸味啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.04,0:20:02.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,應該可以用那個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:03.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:06.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 去田裡收些回來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.19,0:20:07.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,向極星田前進
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:11.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}所 所以說 你們聽我說話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.45,0:20:15.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然目前為止我試吃過無數次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:20.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幾乎沒有人違抗我說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:24.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我的味覺絕對是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:26.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是在這所極星寮中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:29.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,有不同想法的同伴在一起相互碰撞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.49,0:20:32.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,從沒想到過的答案也就誕生出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:35.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是中樞來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:40.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,對你們來說我們可能沒有什麼要認真審視的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.23,0:20:44.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個料理中承載著我們在寮中生活的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.03,0:20:50.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要擊潰的極星寮 我們大家每天相互碰撞的分量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:52.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,正中間的評委
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:57.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,料理的答案是唯一的這種無聊的思考方式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.05,0:20:59.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用我的料理來將其擊碎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:01.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來嚐嚐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:05.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你那頑固的想法一下子就會消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.19,0:21:23.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,重新考慮一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:25.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這也不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:28.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們認為無價值的這種料理
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:30.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.55,0:21:44.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,招待不周
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.07,0:23:20.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣 極星寮就沒事了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.41,0:23:28.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中樞的大家 都在看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.84,0:23:30.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.23,0:23:33.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要是對我的同伴以及熟人出手的話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.97,0:23:35.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我可饒不了你們
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:38.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然對你們來說我們可能是比你們低級的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.43,0:23:41.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但我可沒打算讓你們就這麼小看了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:44.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,被挑釁就要打回去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:46.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我會毫不留情地進行反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.62,0:23:49.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就算對手是十傑的任何一位
